{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":546564,"duration_api_ms":528996,"num_turns":85,"result":"These are just formatting fixes from `cargo fmt` and the missing import fix. Not from our task's amendments. \n\nNow I have everything needed for the ExecutionPayload. Let me collect the summary of what was done across all rounds and produce the final output.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"schema\": \"ExecutionPayload/v1\",\n  \"task_id\": \"tanksim-6e5.4.3\",\n  \"stage\": \"plan_and_implement\",\n  \"cycle\": 1,\n  \"completion_round\": 6,\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"amendments_applied\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"amend-1-kla-cap-asymmetry\",\n      \"title\": \"Remove Euler stability cap from compute_co2_kla, cap at usage site\",\n      \"description\": \"Refactored compute_co2_kla() in chemistry.rs to return the raw physical K_LA(CO2) value without an Euler stability cap. The cap (.min(1.0)) is now applied at the usage site (chemistry.rs:589), matching the O2 path in dissolved_oxygen.rs:94 which also caps at usage. Updated the proportionality test to verify the raw 0.91 ratio holds even when O2 K_LA exceeds 1.0.\",\n      \"files_modified\": [\n        \"crates/tank_core/src/systems/chemistry.rs\",\n        \"crates/tank_core/tests/co2_exchange.rs\"\n      ],\n      \"verification\": \"test_co2_kla_proportional_to_o2_kla passes — asserts exact 0.91 ratio at both moderate and high aeration (where raw O2 K_LA > 1.0)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"amend-2-reset-spawn-accum\",\n      \"title\": \"Reset spawn_progress_accum on zero-population early returns\",\n      \"description\": \"In spawning() (shrimp.rs:424), added spawn_progress_accum = 0.0 resets on both early-return paths: (1) when adult.count == 0, and (2) when eligible spawners == 0. This prevents a stale fractional carry from triggering an immediate spawn when the population later recovers.\",\n      \"files_modified\": [\n        \"crates/tank_core/src/systems/shrimp.rs\"\n      ],\n      \"verification\": \"All 19 shrimp_population tests pass; spawning early-return paths now reset the accumulator\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"amend-3-reset-hatch-carry\",\n      \"title\": \"Reset hatch_success_carry when all egg cohorts are cleared\",\n      \"description\": \"Added hatch_success_carry = 0.0 resets in two locations: (1) egg_development() (shrimp.rs:476) when egg_cohorts is empty and no berried females exist, and (2) clamp_berried_to_adults() (biology.rs:599) when trimming cohorts leaves the list empty after a population reduction. This prevents stale fractional hatch progress from carrying over to future clutches.\",\n      \"files_modified\": [\n        \"crates/tank_core/src/systems/shrimp.rs\",\n        \"crates/tank_core/src/types/biology.rs\"\n      ],\n      \"verification\": \"All 19 shrimp_population tests pass; 8 shrimp_feeding_pathway tests pass\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"test_results\": {\n    \"co2_exchange\": \"12 passed, 0 failed\",\n    \"chemistry\": \"21 passed, 0 failed\",\n    \"dissolved_oxygen\": \"5 passed, 0 failed\",\n    \"save_load\": \"27 passed, 0 failed\",\n    \"validation\": \"12 passed, 0 failed\",\n    \"shrimp_population\": \"19 passed, 0 failed\",\n    \"shrimp_feeding_pathway\": \"8 passed, 0 failed\",\n    \"total\": \"104 passed, 0 failed\"\n  },\n  \"quality_checks\": {\n    \"cargo_fmt\": \"pass (tank_core clean)\",\n    \"cargo_clippy\": \"pass (tank_core -D warnings clean)\",\n    \"pre_existing_issues\": [\n      \"tank_data/presets.rs: 2 dead-code warnings (LegacyMgPerM2 enum variant, unit_requests_area_normalization fn) — unrelated to this task\",\n      \"snapshot::tests::snapshot_deserializes_legacy_chemistry_aliases: pre-existing failure from TDS/carbonate rework in another task — field tan_mg_n_per_l missing in legacy test fixture\",\n      \"concentration_helpers::canonical_helpers_use_net_water_volume: pre-existing failure — TDS calculation now uses projected bicarbonate instead of raw field, test